OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy throughout with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain or drizzle, a few
OL,7,Fheavier bursts possible during the
OL,8,Fmorning, becoming mainly light and
OL,9,Fsporadic during the afternoon. Winds
OL,10,Flight for most.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy initially with a few
OL,13,Fdrizzly outbreaks of rain. Some clear
OL,14,Fspells developing later in the evening
OL,15,Fbefore further cloud and outbreaks of
OL,16,Frain arrive towards dawn. Becoming
OL,17,Fbreezy later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
