OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain for much of the day, some heavy
OL,7,Fat times. Rain clearing for a time
OL,8,Fduring the evening. Windy at times.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,11,Fwith sunny spells for much of
OL,12,FThursday, but rain and strong winds
OL,13,Farriving into the evening and lasting
OL,14,Fmuch of Friday. Sunny spells and a few
OL,15,Fshowers Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
